# INV-001 / INV-016 (RS-A-10): pin the parsed specs + ADR + committed evidence the
# readiness gate reads to LF so the extraction's post-normalization byte caps and the
# compiled SHA-256 content anchors (P1EvidenceAnchors) are stable across platforms.
# A CRLF checkout would change file bytes and dead-red the gate; INV-001 also fails
# closed with a named reason if this pin is absent.
*.md            text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
.correctless/** text eol=lf
docs/**         text eol=lf
